- Analytics import and component usage are syntactically correct

## Next Steps for Deployment

To activate Vercel Web Analytics:
1. Deploy this application to Vercel
2. Navigate to the project dashboard on Vercel
3. Go to the Analytics tab and click "Enable"
4. Once enabled, analytics will automatically start collecting data
5. View analytics data in the Vercel dashboard after deployment

## Files Modified
- `package.json` - Added @vercel/analytics dependency
- `package-lock.json` - Updated with dependency tree
- `src/App.jsx` - Added Analytics import and component

## Technical Notes
- The Analytics component is lightweight and won't impact application performance
- It automatically handles route tracking in single-page applications
- No additional configuration is required for basic analytics tracking
- The component works seamlessly with React 19 and the latest Vite version
